text.section:
The following equipment, at a minimum, shall be immediately available at each mine:

A water car filled with water and provided with hose and pump, or waterlines and necessary hoses;


At least three 20-pound dry chemical fire extinguishers;


Ten 50-pound bags of rock dust, which shall be made available at doors or other strategic places;


Bolt cutters that can be used to cut trolley wire in an emergency;


One pair of rubber gloves that shall be used with each pair of bolt cutters when cutting trolley wire;


Two sledge hammers; and


Five hundred square feet of brattice cloth, nails, and a hammer.
